    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"canvas\" thing... it sounds nice but it's just not real life. it's like being a ghost haunting your own apartment. the person who could compete, who actually felt alive, they died when my career ended. i'm just a shell. it feels like i'm just dragging this broken thing around for no reason. like why even bother trying to find \"new intentions\" for a life that's already over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
